{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ff1a7e01-8e10-82c2-b13d-b4e571e2d66c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T09:14:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diego Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:10:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, morning. I'm calling about a drain. Storm drain, catch basin, whatever you call it. I don't know if this is the right department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:11:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's us. Go ahead, what's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's full of sand. Packed. All that stuff they put down on the road when it ices up, it washed down in there and it just sits. So now the water doesn't go anywhere. The street holds water for about a week after it melts. A week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:11:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so no storm right now, just standing water that won't drain. Let me write that down. Catch basin full of sand, street ponding for about a week. Where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:11:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "170 Admiral Kalbfus Road. North End. Right out front of my house, the basin is at the edge of the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One seventy Admiral Kalbfus. Got it. And it's been like this a while, or is it just this winter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:11:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every time it thaws, it's the same thing. It's been sitting there since the last snow. It's not raining, it's dry out. It's just the sand. Nobody comes and cleans it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:12:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. [pause] Is the water getting up onto your property, or is it just the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:12:10-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the road, so far. But it's a big puddle, and then it freezes at night. I can manage. I'm eighty-some years old, I can go around. But the lady next door is older than me and she can't get out. She won't walk through it, and she's got that walker. She's stuck in the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:12:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's no good, especially with it freezing over. Okay, I'm putting that in the note too, that there's an older neighbor who can't get out because of the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:12:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...so what I'm asking is, can you send somebody to clean the drain. That's all. Clean it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up a little there. You want the drain cleaned out, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:12:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Cleaned. I've got you on the speaker, my hands are no good with the phone. Can you hear me okay now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Loud and clear now. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check and clean that basin. I can't tell you the exact day, they work through a list. But it'll be on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. That's what they all say. I figured this would be a struggle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Let me get a number so they can reach you if they need to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:25-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seven five, perfect. Anything else I should tell them, like which side of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My side. Odd numbers. Right in front of the house, you can't miss it, it's the one with the lake."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the one with the lake. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Look, when I'm not fighting with a puddle, I walk. The bike path out at Sachuest Point is lovely for a walk. I'd rather be doing that than calling you people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:13:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a great spot, no argument. Hopefully we get you back out there. Work order's in, Mr. Ortiz."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:14:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll see. Okay. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T09:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care, you have a good day."
    }
  ],
